      "title": "Build and deploy",
      "items": [
        "Every repository has its own Azure DevOps pipeline",
        "MFE bundles go to their own S3 folder, served behind one CloudFront",
        "API images go to ECR and run as their own ECS service",
        "The shared library is published to Azure Artifacts and consumed by all five APIs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Runtime",
      "items": [
        "The customer signs in once at GIP; the Shell owns the session",
        "The Shell loads every category MFE over Module Federation",
        "Each MFE calls its own Experience API directly — no shared gateway hop",
        "Each Experience API validates the JWT and calls only its own backend system"
      ]
